    - Order flow(sales): sales rep enters customer name and phone number if its an existing customer all the previous measurements, purchases(along with payment status and previous sales person) -> if new customer enter all detials[name, phone, address, email, event date and budget], if existing customer enter event date and budget and other details can be edited -> fabric selection[colour patteren quality] -> design selection[embrodiery, cutting ] -> select garment from catelouge based on the fabric -> take measurements/ edit existing measurements -> spec addons (designs with the location and accerories)  -> order priority is automatically calculated and assigned based on the event date -> calculate the total cost and show the bill break down the sales person can add a discount(show in bill only if discount is added) -> generate bill and collect payment partial/full and give an option to tap pay later(15 days). | trial flow: customer gets notif saying garment is ready for trial -> the customer selects a slot (send notif whn trial comes near) -> during trial the sales rep notes down any changes req 

